    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a standard action, the astrologian can unleash a ball of energy that explodes in a 5-foot radius burst dealing 1d4 points of fire damage per astrologian level. A successful Reflex save halves this damage. This attack has a range of 60 feet. She can fire one explosive ball per day, plus one additional ball per day at 5th level and for every 5 levels thereafter. She can fire more than one ball at a time, but creatures caught inside more than one simultaneous explosions only take damage once.</p>",
